[statement]
Reduced from a layered request over Alpine v3.24 (`main` and `community`,
2026-11-11): `picard`'s closure from v3.23 installed and asked at a later
version. `picard` needs `python3~3.14` and `py3-dateutil`, whose later
build no longer needs `py3-six`. apk upgrades `py3-dateutil`, then
`py3-dateutil-pyc`, whose condition names `py3-dateutil`, and only then
removes `py3-six`, which nothing needs any more: a removal following a
replacement waits until the walk has placed what placing the replacement
led to (`installed/a-package-replaced-frees-what-it-needed-after-what-it-triggers`).

